title: A file is made in the host's folder while a guest has text not saved: it shows on the host's canvas and reaches the guest
folders: share-text
limit: 75
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
expect-log: scanned 'share-text': 5 files
guest-expect-log: scanned 'share-text': 5 files

wait 3000
share start writers
wait 10000
touch fresh.txt made while a guest types
wait 6000
fit
wait 1200
mark host-after-the-new-file
wait 9000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4000
edit notes.txt 2 1
key end
type not-saved-by-beto.
wait 9000
fit
wait 1200
mark after-the-new-file
wait 4000
quit
wait 1500
